Hi Mark.

Many thanks for your efforts. Like you, I do not know anyone who
successfully performed gcRMA on Affymetrix Gene ST or Exon arrays - we
were focused on expression arrays.

Nevertheless sequence effects have shown to be an issue for virtually
all investigated chip types. Their correction is the prime advance of
gcRMA compared to RMA. Also, gcRMA has shown to perform superior to
RMA in the affycomp comparisons. In my opinion, this advance will
propagate to Exon and Gene ST arrays. Let me know if you need more
testers for this devel-branch!

Cheers, Mario.

